Package: GSABenchmark
Type: Package
Title: Tools for benchmarking single-cell gene set analysis methods
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person('Andrei-Florian', 'Stoica', 
    email='andreistoica@foxmail.com',
    role=c('aut','cre'),
    comment=c(ORCID='0000-0002-5253-0826'))
Description: GSABenchmark is a package designed for benchmarking scRNA-seq gene 
    set analysis (scGSA) methods. It provides both traditional and novel 
    benchmark metrics, as well as visualization tools. Currently, GSABenchmark 
    supports 17 scGSA methods.
